title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/iah.jpg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: KPD organizations and funding

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, KPD has many associated organizations. Many led by Willi Münzenberg and have wide reach even outside the party.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare: Fund more mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @welfare_munzenberg: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @rfb: Fund the Rotfrontkämpferbund, our self-defense organization.
- @youth: Fund our youth and women organizations.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.


@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_spd += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@welfare_munzenberg
subtitle: Munzenberg's organization has made this free.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_spd += 5*(1 - dissent);

We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@rfb
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.01; rotfrontkampferbund_timer = 0; funded_reichsbanner += 1

We have increased recruiting to the Rotfrontkämpferbund.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength += 25; young_socialists += 1; workers_kpd += 3; new_middle_kpd += 2

The youth, generally more radical compared to the rest of the population, are quite receptive of our messaging.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations. [ if munzenberg_advisor = 0: I'm sure Münzenberg will pick up the slack...]

- @return: Continue...
